509
00:24:10,365 --> 00:24:11,491
[Zoey] Hmm ?

510
00:24:12,909 --> 00:24:14,244
[rient]

511
00:24:15,954 --> 00:24:17,247
[en chœur] Oh !

512
00:24:19,833 --> 00:24:20,750
[en chœur] Oh !

513
00:24:25,547 --> 00:24:26,590
