633
00:30:34,666 --> 00:30:35,792
Quelle horreur !

634
00:30:35,875 --> 00:30:37,710
Trahies par le cuir.

635
00:30:37,794 --> 00:30:40,547
[le crissement continue]

636
00:30:40,630 --> 00:30:42,674
