Pas le visage !

670
00:32:10,553 --> 00:32:12,180
Il fallait que je vole tes fans.

671
00:32:12,263 --> 00:32:14,974
- [Rumi grogne]
- [musique menaçante]

672
00:32:15,058 --> 00:32:16,434
- [crie]
- [Jinu grogne]

673
00:32:17,060 --> 00:32:18,227
[Rumi grogne]

674
00:32:18,853 --> 00:32:21,230
