687
00:32:54,847 --> 00:32:56,849
[musique d'action]

688
00:32:57,976 --> 00:32:58,893
[grogne]

689
00:33:00,061 --> 00:33:02,522
[grogne]

690
00:33:03,231 --> 00:33:05,400
[grognent]

691
00:33:06,609 --> 00:33:07,986
